&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll turn big-picture fintech strategy and business cases into concrete, end-to-end execution plans that bring Finance, Pricing, R&amp;amp;D, Operations, Compliance, Legal and GTM together. Fintech initiatives at Mews move fast and touch many teams, and this role exists to pressure-test assumptions, connect the numbers to operational reality, and keep momentum instead of stalling in ambiguity. It&#39;s a chance to shape how a growing fintech business sequences its next moves, with real visibility into how strategy becomes execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll coordinate cross-functional fintech initiatives, migrations, product or feature rollouts, process or pricing changes , and build the roadmaps, executive materials and trade-off breakdowns that senior stakeholders use to work out what happens next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Mews&#39; fintech and payments footprint grows, more initiatives draw on the same resources across Finance, Pricing, R&amp;amp;D, Operations, Compliance, Legal and GTM. This role exists to keep those initiatives realistic, sequenced and moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn fintech and payments strategy into clear execution plans and roadmaps, including scope, milestones, owners and success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional fintech initiatives such as migrations, product or feature rollouts, and process or pricing changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge Finance, Pricing and operations by questioning models and turning insights into prioritised, realistic plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create concise, executive-ready materials that explain options, trade-offs and resourcing needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot process gaps and risks across fintech workflows and drive pragmatic improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track actions and next steps to ensure follow-through in a fast-changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role that means going beyond using AI for your own productivity. You would redesign how first-line operations actually run (how the TPSP register is kept current, how vendor performance is assessed, how support and complaints are triaged), build those AI-assisted approaches into something the rest of Mews FS can follow, and rigorously check what the AI produces before it informs a register, a Board pack or a regulatory submission, where the accuracy bar is absolute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot;&gt;&quot;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&quot;&lt;/a&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 - 4 years in consulting, banking, strategy, business analysis or a similar field, ideally in SaaS, fintech or payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience driving or supporting multi-stakeholder initiatives such as migrations, rollouts or process and operating-model changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative and communication skills, comfortable with data, business cases and financial models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence without authority and build relationships across Finance, R&amp;amp;D, Operations, Compliance, Legal and GTM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High tolerance for ambiguity, strong ownership and follow-through, keeping work moving even when things change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI as a real part of your workflow, not as a novelty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of payments or fintech value chains, pricing or unit economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools like Jira, Confluence and Slack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€53.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€70.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£59,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£79,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€59.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€77.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€71.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€93.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
