&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You will sit close to GTM teams, understand how they actually work, and ship production automation that removes manual steps from the commercial stack. You report into ITS during the transition and will move under the GTM organisation once the role is established, working closely with GTM leadership from day one. This is IC5, the most senior individual contributor level at Mews, and it is a pure IC track with no path or expectation into people management.&lt;/p&gt;
