&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role, that means you&#39;ve moved past using AI for your own outreach and into redesigning how outbound gets done for a territory, building research and messaging approaches other reps can pick up and use. You treat AI output as a draft, not a final answer: you check account facts before they reach a hotel owner or GM, and you can point to a specific time you caught and fixed something AI got wrong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/PPL/pages/2370142330/AI+Fluency+at+Mews+A+Guide+for+Candidates&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &quot;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&quot; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
