&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Mews is looking for an Operations Manager to own first-line operational excellence across our Fintech environment. This is a hands-on accountability role for someone who wants to own outcomes in the detail: third-party operations, new-product readiness, customer support and complaints, operational risk, and service performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;You will report directly to the CEO and operate as a senior first-line owner with visibility across leadership, the Board, and relevant stakeholders. Success in this role means orchestrating delivery, maintaining control, driving performance, and ensuring the service runs smoothly for customers. This role partners closely with our Operations Resilience Manager (ORM).&amp;nbsp;The Operations Manager keeps the service running and the customer experience on track. The ORM focuses on resilience, recoverability, and control effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Own third-party operations end to end, acting as the main point of contact for vendors and holding providers to account on onboarding, due diligence, performance, compliance, and issue resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Lead operational readiness for new products and material changes, coordinating review, follow-up, and impact assessment to ensure changes land smoothly and are fully supportable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Act as the key operational link between different stakeholder groups ensuring strong coordination across support, incident response, and third-party delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Oversee customer support and complaints, ensuring issues are resolved promptly, fairly, and in line with internal standards and other expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Own operational risk and SLA monitoring, using clear indicators and reporting to keep senior management and the Board informed and to escalate risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Support continuity during incidents and disruption scenarios, managing customer and operational impact while partnering closely with the ORM on the wider incident and resilience framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Keep operational records accurate and audit-ready, and support internal, external, and other reviews across third-party management and operational controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role that means going beyond using AI for your own productivity. You would redesign how first-line operations actually run (how the TPSP register is kept current, how vendor performance is assessed, how support and complaints are triaged), build those AI-assisted approaches into something the rest of Mews FS can follow, and rigorously check what the AI produces before it informs a register, a Board pack or a regulatory submission, where the accuracy bar is absolute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot;&gt;&quot;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&quot;&lt;/a&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in operations within payments, fintech, financial services, or a similarly controlled environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Genuine hands-on delivery experience, not purely oversight from a distance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Strong experience across third-party governance, regulatory compliance, and customer operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Exposure to operational resilience and business continuity is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Strong project management, communication, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Comfortable owning end-to-end operational processes in a fast-moving, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;High attention to detail, strong judgement, and a high bar for accuracy and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Credibility to operate as a first-line owner with senior leadership, Board, and regulator visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€109.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
