&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building AI-powered products or systems using modern tooling such as Claude, Cursor, Lovable or emerging agent frameworks — with enough understanding of the underlying models to make sound engineering decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 4, or the equivalent hands-on experience shipping products where AI is a core architectural component&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong product instincts: you care about the problem as much as the implementation, and you&#39;ve operated without a dedicated Product Manager or Designer&lt;/li&gt;
